{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校3年18歳の 和田 まあやです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生の皆さんはテ そろそろテストの方多いんじゃないですかー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家での勉強は誘惑が多くて大変ですよね...(^_^;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もがんばってますよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家だとベットやテレビもあって誘惑に負けそうなので昨日は朝からカフェで勉強したよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は誘惑に負けぬようお家で勉強してる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時々勉強はどうやって覚えてるの？って質問があるので、今日は写真を貼りますね ブログ終わったら勉強するよ...ちゃんと...するから..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右下のきっっったない字が書かれてるノートはまあやの勉強方法"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひたすらノートに文字を書いて覚えるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごい字だけどとりあえず書いて書いてそしてまた書いてってして覚えてるの(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノートの板書はわかりやすいように書く努力はするけどテスト前の暗記はこんな感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなはどんな感じで暗記してるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教えてね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはいまから内閣の順番を全部覚えるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/16/2122123/0011.gif